WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.467 --> 00:00:17.588
an instant Roxy changed into Rocket Girl.

2
00:00:17.608 --> 00:00:20.610
"It's time to find that art thief!"

3
00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:21.651
said Roxy.

4
00:00:22.591 --> 00:00:24.092
She blasted up into the sky.

5
00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:31.356
When Roxy arrived at the Metro City Art Gallery, she laughed.

6
00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:35.613
Detective Smith was crawling around on the floor.

7
00:00:35.633 --> 00:00:39.294
"Uh, Detective," Roxy asked with a grin.

8
00:00:39.314 --> 00:00:42.815
"Aren't you a little old to be playing on the floor?"

9
00:00:44.775 --> 00:00:46.636
Detective Smith frowned as he stood up.

10
00:00:46.656 --> 00:00:50.797
"I wasn't playing on the floor," he said.

11
00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:52.617
"I was looking at this."

12
00:00:53.698 --> 00:00:56.558
Detective Smith held up a ball about the size of a baseball.

13
00:00:57.459 --> 00:00:59.479
It had a small lightning bolt on one side.

14
00:01:00.339 --> 00:01:02.180
On the other side was the word "fog."

15
00:01:03.324 --> 00:01:04.625
"Aha!" said Roxy.

16
00:01:04.645 --> 00:01:07.167
"That ball belongs to Weatherman!"

17
00:01:07.187 --> 00:01:08.688
"You're right!"

18
00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:09.869
said Detective Smith.

19
00:01:09.889 --> 00:01:13.671
"He uses Weather Balls to create bad weather.

20
00:01:17.514 --> 00:01:18.454
I talked to a witness.

21
00:01:19.415 --> 00:01:22.777
She said the art gallery was filled with fog during the robbery."

22
00:01:24.038 --> 00:01:25.639
"Hmm," said Roxy.

23
00:01:25.659 --> 00:01:29.062
"So no one could see who was stealing the paintings."

24
00:01:30.182 --> 00:01:32.084
"Exactly!" said Detective Smith.

25
00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.272
Just then his phone rang.

26
00:01:34.292 --> 00:01:36.613
"Hello?" he said.

27
00:01:36.633 --> 00:01:39.274
"Good! Don't lose him!"

28
00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:43.575
Detective Smith hung up his phone and looked at Roxy.

29
00:01:43.595 --> 00:01:46.756
"Police found Weatherman driving down West Street.

30
00:01:47.896 --> 00:01:49.017
They're chasing him now."

31
00:01:50.077 --> 00:01:52.458
Without saying a word, Roxy flew out of the gallery.

32
00:01:54.798 --> 00:01:57.619
On West Street three police cars were chasing a black van.

33
00:01:58.479 --> 00:02:00.820
Two lightning bolts were painted on the van's sides.

34
00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:09.481
Suddenly a thick fog filled the street.

35
00:02:11.461 --> 00:02:14.222
The police lost sight of the van, which darted down an alley.

36
00:02:14.242 --> 00:02:16.983
"More fog, huh?"

37
00:02:17.283 --> 00:02:17.943
said Roxy.

38
00:02:17.963 --> 00:02:20.964
"That's not a problem for Rocket Girl!"

39
00:02:22.164 --> 00:02:24.585
Roxy took a deep breath and blew as hard as she could.

40
00:02:25.625 --> 00:02:26.885
The fog cleared instantly.

41
00:02:27.926 --> 00:02:30.586
Now Roxy could see Weatherman's van a few blocks away.

42
00:02:31.727 --> 00:02:32.567
She flew after it.

43
00:02:36.528 --> 00:02:40.170
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams, burning a hole in the back of the van.

44
00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:45.052
The van skidded to a stop, and Weatherman jumped out.

45
00:02:45.072 --> 00:02:49.374
"You ruined the Weather Van!"

46
00:02:49.734 --> 00:02:50.254
he yelled.

47
00:02:50.274 --> 00:02:53.675
"You're going to pay for that, Rocket Girl!"

48
00:02:55.956 --> 00:02:58.357
Weatherman grabbed a Weather Ball from the back of the van.

49
00:03:00.538 --> 00:03:01.619
He threw it into the air.

50
00:03:01.639 --> 00:03:04.240
"Weather Ball, activate!"

51
00:03:09.792 --> 00:03:11.135
The whole sky grew dark.

52
00:03:12.056 --> 00:03:12.878
Clouds moved in.

53
00:03:13.859 --> 00:03:15.101
And then—crack!

54
00:03:15.963 --> 00:03:18.307
A giant lightning bolt shot down from the sky.

55
00:03:19.188 --> 00:03:21.011
And it was headed straight toward Roxy!
